
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Try what we build</span>
        <h1>These aren't screenshots. They're working examples.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Real, clickable demos — built for fictional businesses. Try any of them.</p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="start">Get a price for yours</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="free-mockup">Free website mockup</a>
        </div>
        <p class="callout" style="max-width:52rem"><strong>Demo data only.</strong> Prices, numbers and answers are sample content for illustration. The AI assistant answers from a small set of sample documents, not a live account.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-label="Interactive demos">
      <div class="container">

        <!-- DEMO 1 — quote calculator -->
        <article class="demo" id="quote-calculator">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · Custom software</span>
            <h2>Mike's Plumbing — Quote Calculator</h2>
            <p>A customer picks a job and a few options and gets an instant estimate they can send straight to WhatsApp. No back-and-forth, no waiting. This is the kind of small custom software that starts from about R1,000.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="free-mockup?demo=quote-calculator&amp;type=plumb&amp;include=Instant%20quote%20calculator%2C%20WhatsApp%20button%2C%20services%20and%20areas" class="btn btn--primary">Get a free mockup like this →</a>
              <a href="start?type=Custom%20Software" class="btn btn--ghost">Start a project</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">quote.mikesplumbing.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body">
              <label class="demo__field">Job type
                <select id="q-job">
                  <option value="450" data-min="1">Tap / mixer repair — R450</option>
                  <option value="650" data-min="1">Blocked drain — R650</option>
                  <option value="1200" data-min="2">Toilet replacement — R1,200</option>
                  <option value="2500" data-min="2">Geyser installation — R2,500</option>
                  <option value="8000" data-min="0">Bathroom renovation — from R8,000</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <div>
                <span class="label" style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:0.45rem">Add-ons</span>
                <div class="demo__opts">
                  <label><input type="checkbox" id="q-after" value="300" /> After-hours (+R300)</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" id="q-callout" value="150" /> Call-out fee (+R150)</label>
                  <label><input type="checkbox" id="q-parts" value="400" /> Est. parts (+R400)</label>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="demo__total"><span>Estimated total</span><b id="q-total">R450</b></div>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" id="q-wa">Copy this quote for WhatsApp</button>
              <p class="demo__note">// Demo — copies a pre-filled message you can paste into WhatsApp.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- DEMO 2 — sales dashboard -->
        <article class="demo" id="sales-dashboard">
          <div class="demo__intro reveal">
            <span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo · Dashboard</span>
            <h2>Example Sales Co. — Sales Dashboard</h2>
            <p>Your spreadsheets, turned into one screen you can read at a glance. Switch the period and every number and bar updates. This replaces the Friday-afternoon report someone builds by hand — dashboards start around R2,000.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a href="start?type=Dashboard" class="btn btn--primary">Build something similar →</a>
              <a href="free-mockup?demo=sales-dashboard&amp;include=A%20dashboard%20built%20from%20my%20spreadsheets" class="btn btn--free">Mockup first <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo__panel reveal">
            <div class="demo__bar"><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--r"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--y"></span><span class="demo__dot demo__dot--g"></span><span class="demo__title">dashboard.examplesales.co.za</span></div>
            <div class="demo__body">
              <div class="demo__seg" id="d-seg" aria-label="Choose a period">
                <button type="button" data-p="month" class="is-active">This month</button>
                <button type="button" data-p="last">Last month</button>
                <button type="button" data-p="quarter">This quarter</button>
